-> [!NOTE]
-> **Port allocation (Packet 004):** preferred ports still use
-> `base + sha1(path)[:4] % 100` (or existing envrc values), but assignment goes
-> through the **lease registry** (`~/.dopemux/mcp/runtime/port-leases.json`).
